  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of a Kenya National Research Repository Pilot and Entrepreneurial Maturity Framework (RDEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kenya National Research Repository will enable the general public and even global audiences access research outputs. It will also enhance the visibility of research outputs from and for researchers to various external audiences via a free online access platform. The repository will provide a national platform for different actors in the S,T&amp;I space to engage and access data and information on previously completed research projects, research funders and collaborators, research disseminations methods, S,T&amp;I outputs and outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
